# Kenrith's Transformation: "When this Aura enters, draw a card. Enchanted creature loses all abilities and is a green Elk
# creature with base power and toughness 3/3." Bot1 enchants Bot2's Samut, Hazoret's Champion (a red 2/2 Human Warrior
# Cleric with "Creatures you control have haste") and draws the Ornithopter on top of its library. Samut is a green Elk
# creature 3/3, no longer a Human, Warrior or Cleric and no longer red, but still legendary - a supertype is no card type
# (the ruling: "the creature keeps any supertypes"). Its haste-giving ability is gone: the Llanowar Elves Bot2 casts on turn 4
# are summoning sick (CR 302.6), where the Elves cast on turn 2 attacked at once.

